{"c":[{"name":"20261023T220226Z-0a3553df5a1ac252","text":"2026-10-23: warehouse-file-growth at 36b3c4d is main plus the memory bank. Milestone 4 doctor storage report passed preflight with an advisory. live_bytes stays the union of persistent block ids, dropping ids below 0. Build has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T224558Z-a0c4edb3a448542b","text":"argparse's default help formatter replaces a space with a newline, so a two-word --help assertion can fail. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","type":"note"}]}
